# Local build artifacts only.
#
# Do NOT ignore db.json.zip or downloader_*.ini/.zip here: the database builder
# creates those and runs `git add` on them when it publishes the `db` branch,
# and `git add` of an ignored path exits non-zero, which fails the workflow.
# (Learned the hard way: the first published build failed on exactly that.)
db.json
__pycache__/
